    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these, they're okay, but they feel a bit dry/robotic. i know i said don't go overboard, but even these have basically zero positivity score. \n\nit's important that the user doesn't feel like they're getting a \"rejection\" from a machine. we want them to feel like the app is on their side, maybe even a bit warm/friendly so they'll check their balance and try again instead of just closing the app in frustration.\n\ncan you try again? try to aim for a higher sentiment score this time. just be careful—i'm serious about it not being bubbly or mocking, but we definitely need more \"warmth\" than what you just gave me. maybe try to make them feel more uplifting or supportive?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
